flowchart TD
    U[User: Teen / Parent / Supervisor] --> T[T — Primary Assistant]
    T --> IC[Intent & Context]
    IC --> G1[GUARD — Safety Kernel]
    G1 -->|ALLOW / DEFER / REQUIRE_* / ESCALATE / DENY| A{T-Crew Specialist Agent}

    A --> VIBE[VIBE — Journey/Navigation]
    A --> READY[READY — Permit Prep]
    A --> ACE[ACE — Driving & Insurance Learning]
    A --> MILES[MILES — Session Logging]
    A --> CRUZE[CRUZE — Practice Planning]
    A --> GO[GO — Licensing Milestones]
    A --> COVER[COVER — Insurance Prep]

    VIBE --> DS[Domain Services]
    READY --> DS
    ACE --> DS
    MILES --> DS
    CRUZE --> DS
    GO --> DS
    COVER --> DS

    DS --> JG[Journey Graph]
    DS --> RG[Requirement Graph]
    DS --> FG[Family Graph]
    DS --> EG[Evidence Graph]
    DS --> IG[Insurance Profile]

    JG --> DB[(PostgreSQL / Supabase)]
    RG --> DB
    FG --> DB
    EG --> DB
    IG --> DB

    DS --> G2[GUARD — post-action check]
    G2 --> T
    T --> U

    subgraph Drive Mode
        MILES --> DM[Drive Session]
        DM -->|offline-tolerant| SV[Supervisor Verification]
        SV --> JG
    end

    G1 -.audit.-> AUDIT[(AuditEvent / SafetyDecision Log)]
    G2 -.audit.-> AUDIT
